  "description": "<p>⭐ <strong>Windsor Castle, Stonehenge &amp; Bath: Day Trip from London</strong> offers the opportunity to visit two UNESCO World Heritage sites, St George's Chapel and Stonehenge, and also includes a visit to the beautiful city of Bath.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ticket types</strong><br>\n🎫 Adult (17-59)<br>\n🎫 Senior (60+)<br>\n🎫 Student (with ID) - Reduced<br>\n🎫 Family 2 + 2 - Regular</p>\n\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🏰 Join the quintessential British escapade fit for royalty<br>\n👑 Step into the enchanting world of British royalty as you visit the historic Windsor Castle<br>\n🗿 Be captivated by the mysterious allure of Stonehenge, one of the world's most famous UNESCO World Heritage sites<br>\n🏘️&nbsp;Immerse yourself in the pure charm of Bath, a city known for its picturesque beauty</p>\n\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Date: various dates available (select during purchase)<br>\n🕒 Time:&nbsp;Boarding at&nbsp;7:30 a.m. - Departure at 8:00 a.m.<br>\n⏳ Duration:&nbsp;11 hours and 30 minutes<br>\n📍 Location: a guide team will be waiting for you at Victoria Coach Station<br>\n👤 Age requirement: 5+<br>\n📝 On Sundays, St George's Chapel is not accessible</p>\n\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nEmbark on the quintessential British adventure fit for royalty! Explore not one, but two UNESCO World Heritage sites. Experience romance at St. George's Chapel, where the iconic Harry and Meghan exchanged vows. Then, prepare to be mesmerized by the enigmatic allure of Stonehenge. But there's even more in store! Immerse yourself in the captivating beauty of Bath, a place steeped in pure rural charm. With a knowledgeable guide, enlightening audio guides, and a supremely comfortable coach complete with WiFi, this awe-inspiring tour promises an extraordinary day filled with regal splendor and cultural wonders. Get your tickets now!</p>",
